},
{
"p": 4,
"t": "“My name is Sam. My address is 14 Maple Street, Apartment 3.”",
"s": 22.7
},
{
"p": 5,
"t": "“Great. This plan is thirty dollars a month. It has a lot of data.”",
"s": 28.0
},
{
"p": 6,
"t": "“Thirty dollars a month? That is good.”",
"s": 32.84
},
{
"p": 7,
"t": "Jen gives me a little card for my phone.",
"s": 35.03
},
{
"p": 7,
"t": "“Your new number is 555-274-8190,” she says.",
"s": 38.52
},
{
"p": 8,
"t": "I say the numbers slowly: “Five, five, five, two, seven, four, eight, one, nine, zero.” Jen smiles.",
"s": 43.77
},
{
"p": 8,
"t": "“Perfect!”",
"s": 51.56
},
{
"p": 9,
"t": "At home, I call Rosa.",
"s": 51.86
},
{
"p": 9,
"t": "“Hi, Rosa! This is Sam. This is my new number!”",
"s": 54.9
},
{
"p": 10,
"t": "“Great! Now I can call you, and you can call me.”",
"s": 58.65
},
{
"p": 11,
"t": "Max barks next to her.",
